  Action: values, err := liveStore.GetAll(ctx, vehicleID, LiveSignalReadDistributed)
  Assertions:
    - signalA value comes from L2 (newer timestamp wins)
    - signalB value comes from L1 (newer timestamp wins)
    - signalC value comes from L1 (legacy zero-timestamp loses to any
