    - signalD value comes from L2 (tie-break to L2 on equal timestamps)

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  T5. TestHybridLiveSignalStoreGetSignalAppliesSameMergeRuleAsGetAll
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Rule: R5 (GetSignal honors merge rule per single name).
  Setup (table-driven, one sub-test per matrix row):
